Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.84,Kick,,0,0,0,,WORLD · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.84,Title,,0,0,0,,TRUMP, XI AND PUTIN\NMEET IN CHINA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.84,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: ABC News · Moscow Times · Daily Sabah\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}NO CUTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Three leaders with thousands of nuclear weapons met in China. Here is what they agreed, and what they left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:14.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}It did not mention the war in Ukraine, or the war with Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Who is affected?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:17.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Ukraine did not take part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:21.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Nor did Germany, France, Britain, Japan or South Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:22.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Why it matters:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:29.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}the United States and Russia each have more than five thousand nuclear warheads, and China has more than six hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:33.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The leaders said a nuclear war should never be fought, but they announced no cuts.
